          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="ch"><span class="ci">🧪</span><span class="ct">STANDARD PROCTOR COMPACTION</span></div>
      <div class="cb">
        <div class="fbox"><span class="fx">ρ_d = ρ_bulk / (1 + w)</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <span class="fx">e = (G_s·ρ_w/ρ_d) − 1</span><br><span class="fx">Sr = G_s·w / e</span> (degree of saturation)</div>
        <div class="fr fr2"><div class="fg"><label>Bulk Density ρ (kN/m³)</label><input type="number" id="pr_rb" value="19.5" step="0.1"></div><div class="fg"><label>Moisture Content w (%)</label><input type="number" id="pr_w" value="12" step="0.5"></div></div>
        <div class="fr fr2"><div class="fg"><label>Specific Gravity G_s</label><input type="number" id="pr_Gs" value="2.67" step="0.01"></div><div class="fg"><label>OMC Target (%)</label><input type="number" id="pr_omc" value="14"></div></div>
        <button class="btn btn-a" onclick="calcProctor()">▶ CALCULATE</button>
        <div id="pr2_r" class="rbox" style="display:none">
          <div class="rgrid">
            <div class="ri"><div class="rl">Dry Density (kN/m³)</div><div class="rv" id="pr_rd"></div></div>
            <div class="ri"><div class="rl">Void Ratio e</div><div class="rv" id="pr_e"></div></div>
            <div class="ri"><div class="rl">Saturation Sr (%)</div><div class="rv" id="pr_Sr"></div></div>
            <div class="ri"><div class="rl">vs OMC</div><div class="rv" id="pr_omc2"></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="ch"><span class="ci">🧪</span><span class="ct">PARTICLE SIZE — GRADING ANALYSIS</span></div>
      <div class="cb">
        <div class="fbox"><span class="fx">D₁₀, D₃₀, D₆₀</span> from grading curve<br><span class="fx">C_u = D₆₀/D₁₀</span> (Uniformity Coeff) &nbsp;|&nbsp; <span class="fx">C_c = D₃₀²/(D₆₀·D₁₀)</span></div>
        <div class="fr fr3"><div class="fg"><label>D₁₀ (mm)</label><input type="number" id="gs_d10" value="0.08" step="0.01"></div><div class="fg"><label>D₃₀ (mm)</label><input type="number" id="gs_d30" value="0.3" step="0.01"></div><div class="fg"><label>D₆₀ (mm)</label><input type="number" id="gs_d60" value="1.2" step="0.1"></div></div>
        <button class="btn btn-a" onclick="calcGrading()">▶ CLASSIFY</button>
        <div id="gs_r" class="rbox" style="display:none">
          <div class="rgrid">
            <div class="ri"><div class="rl">C_u</div><div class="rv" id="gs_Cu"></div></div>
            <div class="ri"><div class="rl">C_c</div><div class="rv" id="gs_Cc2"></div></div>
            <div class="ri"><div class="rl">Grading</div><div class="rv" id="gs_grade"></div></div>
