    <div class="card">
      <div class="ch"><span class="ci">🧪</span><span class="ct">PERMEABILITY &amp; SEEPAGE</span></div>
      <div class="cb">
        <div class="fbox"><span class="fx">v = k·i</span> (Darcy's Law) &nbsp;|&nbsp; <span class="fx">q = k·i·A</span><br><span class="fx">k_h = (k₁h₁+k₂h₂+...)/H</span> (layered, horizontal)<br>Hazen: <span class="fx">k = C·D₁₀²</span> (cm/s, C≈100)</div>
