      <div class="cb">
        <div class="fbox"><span class="fx">D = (k_d·L_0)/(k_r−k_d) · (e^(−k_d·t) − e^(−k_r·t)) + D_0·e^(−k_r·t)</span><br>D=deficit, L_0=initial BOD, D_0=initial deficit, k_d=deoxygenation, k_r=reaeration</div>
